                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Storer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-11-06"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Hay directs that all passports or cedulas presented by citizens of Porto
                    Rico and Cuba, and all passports or cedulas presented by natives of the
                    Philippines, when issued or countersigned by the military authorities of the
                    United States in these islands, shall be registered and viséed.]</p>
            </div>
